\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 If anyone can get the \uc2 US government\uc2  to take deepfake porn seriously, it\u8217\'20\'19s Swifties\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,285 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 January 2024\par 16:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Their collective anger over AI-generated sexually explicit images of Taylor Swift may help spur changes to federal law when it comes to deepfake porn\par \par \uc2 Can Swifties be the force that finally stops deepfake porn?\par \par \uc2 Sexually explicit photographs of Taylor Swift are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/jan/26/taylor-swift-deepfake-pornography-sparks-renewed-calls-for-us-legislation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 all over the internet}}}\uc2 . Except they are not actually pictures of Swift: they are deepfakes created with AI technology. Still, the fact they are computer generated doesn\u8217\'20\'19t mean the photos don\u8217\'20\'19t look horrifyingly realistic \u8211\'20\'13 and it certainly hasn\u8217\'20\'19t stopped people from gawking at them. One of the images shared by a user on X (\uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gizmodo.com/taylor-swift-ai-porn-campaign-on-elon-musk-twitter-1851197558"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 viewed more than 45m times}}}\uc2  in the 17 hours before it was taken down.\par \par \uc2 If this story sounds familiar it\u8217\'20\'19s because you\u8217\'20\'19ve probably heard a variation of it before. Deepfake pornography is everywhere \u8211\'20\'13 according to Danielle Citron, a professor at the University of Virginia School of Law, there are over more than 9,500 sites \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2023/10/29/opinions/deepfake-pornography-thriving-business-compton-hamlyn/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 devoted to non-consensual intimate imagery}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D. It used to take hundreds of images of someone and an immense amount of computer processing power to create a convincing deepfake. Now you just need a couple of a photos of someone\u8217\'20\'19s face and a phone app. While Swift may be one of the most recent, and most high-profile, victims of the technology, it has upended an enormous number of lives.\par \par \uc2 More specifically, it\u8217\'20\'19s upended the lives of girls and women. While men aren\u8217\'20\'19t immune to being victims of other forms of AI-generated imagery, deepfake porn overwhelmingly targets women. A 2019 report by cybersecurity company Deeptrace labs, for example, found that non-consensual deepfake pornography accounted for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://regmedia.co.uk/2019/10/08/deepfake_report.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 96% of the total deepfake videos online}}}\uc2  and concluded that the phenomenon \u8220\'20\'1Cexclusively targets and harms women\u8221\'20\'1D. In the years since the Deeptrace report came out that harm has only increased. There has also been an uptick in cases involving deepfakes of minors. Last year, for example, boys at a New Jersey high school created and shared sexually explicit AI-generated imagery of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/tech/tech-news/deepfake-law-ai-new-jersey-high-school-teen-image-porn-rcna133706"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than 30 teenage girls}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Deepfake porn, it can\u8217\'20\'19t be stressed enough, isn\u8217\'20\'19t meant to titillate \u8211\'20\'13 it\u8217\'20\'19s often meant to humiliate. Being a woman with any sort of public platform means dealing with harassment online: deepfake porn is yet another tool that troll armies and misogynists are weaponizing to punish women who behave in ways they don\u8217\'20\'19t like. It\u8217\'20\'19s meant to shut women up, to drive them offline. When high-profile figures like Swift are targeted with deepfake porn, it sends a message to young girls: put your head above the parapet and you will be punished for it. It doesn\u8217\'20\'19t matter how successful you are, how many billions you have in the bank, the world will still find a way to objectify and humiliate you.\par \par \uc2 Girls, by the way, are hearing this message loud and clear. A 2022 study in the UK found that girls aged nine-to-18 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gdst.net/education/the-girls-futures-report/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ranked \u8220\'20\'1Cbeing a leader\u8221\'20\'1D the lowest priority}}}\uc2  in a list of 17 attributes for future work. Why would they want to be leaders, why would they want to be in the public eye, when they see what sort of abuse those {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2022/oct/09/girls-dont-want-to-be-leaders-no-wonder-when-you-see-the-violent-abuse-they-could-face"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 women receive}}}\uc2  ?\par \par \uc2 Swift, for her part, hasn\u8217\'20\'19t released an official statement about the fake nude images that have been circulating, but, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-13006645/taylor-swift-furious-ai-pictures-porn-legal-action.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to the Daily Mail}}}\uc2 , she is furious about the pictures and is considering taking legal action. Swift\u8217\'20\'19s devoted fans are also furious and they have been taking more immediate action. Swift fans mass-reported accounts sharing the deepfakes and also posted thousands of images tagged with phrases like \u8220\'20\'1CTaylor Swift AI\u8221\'20\'1D to make the deepfakes hard to find.\par \par \uc2 If there is a silver lining to this sordid situation it is this: angry Swifties are a force to be reckoned with. If anyone can get the government to take deepfake porn seriously, if anyone can get social media platforms to pay attention, it is Swift\u8217\'20\'19s enormous and extremely motivated fan base. Let\u8217\'20\'19s not forget the Great \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2  Fiasco of 2022, shall we? After \uc2 Ticketmaster\uc2  made a mess of presale tickets for Swift\u8217\'20\'19s Eras Tour, lawmakers in the US started making a lot of noise about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2022/nov/19/taylor-swift-ticketmaster-week-in-patriarchy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anti-competitive practices in the music industry}}}\uc2 . Swift\u8217\'20\'19s fans managed to make antitrust law a mainstream talking point. Now their collective anger may help spur changes to federal law when it comes to deepfake porn.\par \par \uc2 And that change can\u8217\'20\'19t come soon enough. While some individual US states have passed laws aimed at curtailing the sharing of deepfake porn without consent, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2023-11-29/us-federal-laws-fail-to-protect-most-deepfake-pornography-victims"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 there is no federal law}}}\uc2  which criminalizes the creation or sharing of fake pornographic images. Victims have very little recourse. And as lawmakers drag their feet, use of this technology is growing rapidly. While the imagery may be fake, the harm it is causing is very, very real.\par \par \uc2 There have been more than 64,000 rape-caused pregnancies in US states with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans since 2022\par \par \uc2 That {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/sections/health-shots/2024/01/24/1226161416/rape-caused-pregnancy-abortion-ban-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 horrifying figure is}}}\uc2  from a research letter published in Jama Internal Medicine. \u8220\'20\'1CSexual assault is incredibly common \u8211\'20\'13 I knew that in a general sense,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/sections/health-shots/2024/01/24/1226161416/rape-caused-pregnancy-abortion-ban-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one of the researchers told NPR}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CBut to be confronted with these estimates that are so high in states where there\u8217\'20\'19s no meaningful \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access? It\u8217\'20\'19s hard to comprehend.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 US women who miscarry are in dangerous legal limbo post-Roe\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now essentially banned in 14 US states \u8211\'20\'13 and the laws on miscarriages are dangerously vague. \uc2 The Guardian\uc2  looks at the human cost of this \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/jan/24/us-miscarriage-laws-abortion-rights-options"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 murky legal landscape}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Republican compares women to livestock\par \par \uc2 During a debate about a potential 14-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, Wisconsin state representative Joel Kitchens told his colleagues he\u8217\'20\'19s basically an expert on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  because \u8230\'20\'26 he\u8217\'20\'19s a vet. \u8220\'20\'1CYou know, in my veterinary career, I did thousands of ultrasounds on animals, you know, determining pregnancy and that kind of thing,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.huffpost.com/entry/wisconsin-state-rep-joel-kitchens-abortion-livestock_n_65b2e896e4b077c17ab49b22"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kitchens said}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CSo I think I know mammalian fetal development better than probably anyone here.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 There has been a 300% increase in the miscarriage rate in Gaza\par \par \uc2 Healthcare workers report a giant increase in the miscarriage rate since Israel\u8217\'20\'19s relentless bombing campaign began three months ago, Nour Beydoun, Care\u8217\'20\'19s regional adviser on protection and gender in emergencies, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://jezebel.com/miscarriages-in-gaza-have-increased-300-under-israeli-1851168680"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Jezebel}}}\uc2 . Funnily enough the pro-life crowd in the US is cheering this on.\par \par \uc2 Hillary Clinton\uc2  has had Kenough\par \par \uc2 As you have probably heard (9m thinkpieces have been written on the issue), Barbie\u8217\'20\'19s director, Greta Gerwig, and star, Margot Robbie, were not nominated for Oscars while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2024/jan/24/barbie-ryan-gosling-margot-robbie-greta-gerwig-oscars-snub"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ryan Gosling was}}}\uc2 . Clinton addressed this incredibly tragic state of affairs with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/hillary-clinton-barbie-oscar-snub-margot-robbie-and-greta-gerwig/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the world\u8217\'20\'19s cringiest tweet}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Lily Gladstone has become the first Native American to be nominated for an Oscar for best actress\par \par \uc2 Gladstone\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/lily-gladstone-historic-oscar-nomination-osage-community-supporting-her-career/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 historic nomination}}}\uc2  is a result of her role in Killers of the Flower Moon.\par \par \uc2 Swimming in cold water can significantly reduce menopause symptoms\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/jan/25/cold-water-swimming-eases-menopause-and-menstrual-symptoms-study-finds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 While the evidence is anecdotal}}}\uc2 , researchers said cold water swimming \u8220\'20\'1Ccan be used by women to alleviate physical symptoms, such as hot flushes, aches and pains\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The week in pawtriarchy\par \par \uc2 Valentine\u8217\'20\'19s Day is coming up and, if you\u8217\'20\'19re not in a particularly loving mood, a Rhode Island animal charity is running the promotion for you. For a $5 donation, the charity will write the name of your ex (or something/someone you loathe) on a paper heart and put it in the shelter\u8217\'20\'19s kitty litter {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://okcfox.com/news/offbeat/rhode-island-spcas-love-stinks-promotion-will-bury-exs-name-into-litter-box-cat-kitty-anti-valentines-campaign-donations-grants-shelter-january-22-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to be pooped on}}}\uc2 . It seems like a lot of people are looking for \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://host.nxt.blackbaud.com/registration-form/?formId=e63578f3-ec86-49cc-bd84-c150f820ad98&envId=p-FFpFyPFKVkegwm1ylfn4WQ&zone=usa&fbclid=IwAR2T2LGlUaWCOLNbZj6wrKW6_yzRxWlYD3Lt4vEIrNZdLB5tHqtd4a8tbCw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 retripootion}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D because the promotion has already proved very popular indeed.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240127ek1r001e2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
