\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  claims credit for \u8216\'20\'18miracle\u8217\'20\'19 of overturning right to  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 David Smith in Washington \par \uc2 719 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 January 2024\par 15:20 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ex-president tries to walk fine line on issue, saying Republicans with extreme positions have been \u8216\'20\'18decimated\u8217\'20\'19 in elections\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , the former US president, boasted about the \u8220\'20\'1Cmiracle\u8221\'20\'1D of ending the constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  but warned that Republicans who tout extreme bans are being \u8220\'20\'1Cdecimated\u8221\'20\'1D in elections.\par \par \uc2 Trump was put on the spot on Wednesday during {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxnews.com/politics/how-where-watch-fox-news-town-hall-donald-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a Fox News town hall}}}\uc2  in Des Moines, Iowa, his latest attempt at counter-programming a Republican debate that was being shown on CNN at the same time.\par \par \uc2 A female voter, undecided between Trump and rival \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , raised concerns over the Republican frontrunner\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/dec/03/donald-trump-abortion-republicans-2024-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent attempts to back away}}}\uc2  from \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions unpopular in elections and opinion polls.\par \par \uc2 She said: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19ve been vocal in celebrating with you all of your pro-life victories from the past but then in this campaign you\u8217\'20\'19ve also blamed pro-lifers for some of the GOP losses around the country and you\u8217\'20\'19ve called heartbeat laws like Iowa\u8217\'20\'19s terrible.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The voter added: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19d just like some clarity on this because it\u8217\'20\'19s such an important question to me. I\u8217\'20\'19d like for you to reassure me that you can protect all life, every person\u8217\'20\'19s right to life without compromise.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump, sitting with co-hosts Bret Baier and Martha MacCallum, sought to shore up his conservative credentials by taking credit for the 2022 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/may/10/divided-america-roe-v-wade-supreme-court-cold-civil-war"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning of Roe v Wade}}}\uc2 , the ruling that guaranteed the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  nationwide, by a supreme court with three Trump-appointed justices.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C You wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be asking that question, even talking about the issue, because for 54 years they were trying to get Roe v Wade terminated, and I did it, and I\u8217\'20\'19m proud to have done it,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CNobody else was going to get that done but me, and we did it, and we did something that was a miracle.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But as he has in recent campaign rallies, Trump also struck a note of caution. \u8220\'20\'1C Now, I happen to be for the exceptions, like \uc2 Ronald Reagan\uc2 , with the life of the mother, rape, incest. I just have to be there, I feel. I think probably 78% or so, a poll, about 78%. It was \uc2 Ronald Reagan\uc2 . He was for it. I was for it.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut I will say this: you have to win elections. Otherwise you\u8217\'20\'19re going to be back where you were, and you can\u8217\'20\'19t let that ever happen again. You\u8217\'20\'19ve got to win elections.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump suggested that Florida governor DeSantis\u8217\'20\'19s decision to sign {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/apr/13/florida-six-week-abortion-ban-republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a six-week \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban}}}\uc2  could be one of the reasons for his drop in the polls ahead of Monday\u8217\'20\'19s first presidential nomination contest in Iowa.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA lot of people say, if you talk five or six weeks, a lot of women don\u8217\'20\'19t know if they\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant in five or six weeks,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CI want to get something where people are happy. You know, this has been tearing our country apart for 50 years. Nobody\u8217\'20\'19s been able to do anything.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump went on to claim that Democrats were \u8220\'20\'1Cthe radicals\u8221\'20\'1D and repeated his false {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/sep/27/abortion-myths-republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claim}}}\uc2  that they are willing to kill babies in the eighth or ninth month of pregnancy or even after birth.\par \par \uc2 The exchange illustrated how Trump, who has a long history of veering between \u8220\'20\'1Cpro-choice\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cpro-life\u8221\'20\'1D positions, is attempting to walk a fine line between his conservative base and electoral expediency.\par \par \uc2 But his embrace of the demise of Roe v Wade handed Democrats more ammunition. \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s X account {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JoeBiden/status/1745290159304622336?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released a video clip}}}\uc2  of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s answer, commenting: \u8220\'20\'1CJust like he said: he did it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The 77-year-old also used the town hall to claim that he was \u8220\'20\'1Cnot going to be a dictator\u8221\'20\'1D but also promise \u8220\'20\'1Cthe largest deportation effort in the history of our country\u8221\'20\'1D. He also revealed that he had decided the identity of his running mate.\par \par \uc2 Asked who he would pick as potential vice-president, Trump replied: \u8220\'20\'1CWell, I can\u8217\'20\'19t tell you that, really. I mean, I know who it\u8217\'20\'19s going to be, but \u8211\'20\'13 \u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Baier entreated: \u8220\'20\'1CGive us a hint.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But Trump offered only: \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ll do another show some time.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240111ek1b000gq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
