\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  :  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  bans passed by \u8216\'20\'18extremist\u8217\'20\'19 people causing \u8216\'20\'18chaos, confusion and fear\u8217\'20\'19 - as it happened\b0\par\par\uc2 Maya Yang \par \uc2 2,837 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2023\par 20:43 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This blog is now closed. For all the latest news on the vehicle explosion near Niagara Falls, join us in our dedicated live blog:US-Canada border vehicle explosion \u8211\'20\'13 latest updates\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 7.01pm GMT\par \par \uc2 We\u8217\'20\'19ve launched a standalone blog following the latest developments after a vehicle explosion at the US-Canada border.\par \par \uc2 Join us here to follow the latest news and reaction:\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2023/nov/22/ny-canada-border-explosion-car-rainbow-bridge-latest-updates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US-Canada border: FBI investigating after vehicle explosion at Rainbow Bridge checkpoint \u8211\'20\'13 live }}}\par \par \uc2 The politics blog will pause for now.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.52pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Dramatic images and clips are coming through on the vehicle explosion at the international bridge near the Niagara Falls, but it\u8217\'20\'19s a very fluid situation in terms of official information emerging at this point.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FBI\uc2  is investigating and, according to CNN, also the US Alcohol, Tobacco and Firearms (ATF) federal agency.\par \par \uc2 Reports so far suggest that a car that was entering the US from Canada, where there are toll booths and officials, exploded. There are no reports yet of any victims but this is all unfolding.\par \par \uc2 enltrThe \uc2 FBI\uc2  is investigating the car explosion on the Rainbow Bridge connecting Buffalo, New York and Victoria Falls, Canada. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/3JxMezr1pI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/3JxMezr1pI }}}\uc2  is investigating the car explosion on the Rainbow Bridge connecting Buffalo, New York and Victoria Falls, Canada.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Andy Ng\u244\'00\'F4 ?????? (@MrAndyNgo) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MrAndyNgo/status/1727395896089030778?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 22, 2023 }}}\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.42pm GMT\par \par \uc2 A border crossing between the US and Canada has been closed after a vehicle exploded at a checkpoint on a bridge near Niagara Falls, the Associated Press reports.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Bureau of Investigation\uc2  (\uc2 FBI\uc2  )\u8217\'20\'19s field office in Buffalo, in upstate New York, said in a statement that it was investigating the explosion on the so-called Rainbow Bridge, which connects the two countries across the Niagara River.\par \par \uc2 Photos and video taken by news organizations and posted on social media showed a security booth that had been singed by flames.\par \par \uc2 Further information wasn\u8217\'20\'19t immediately available.\par \par \uc2 New York governor, \uc2 Kathy Hochul\uc2  , a Democrat, said she had been briefed on the incident and was \u8220\'20\'1Cclosely monitoring the situation\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Images and clips are emerging on social media.\par \par \uc2 enltr?? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BREAKING?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BREAKING }}}\uc2  : A vehicle entering a toll booth at Rainbow Bridge has caused a large explosion to go off, prompting evacuations.\u176\'00\'B0\u176\'00\'B0?? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/NiagaraFalls?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #NiagaraFalls }}}\uc2  | {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Canada?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Canada }}}\uc2  |\par \par \uc2 Currently, multiple authorities and emergency personnel are on the scene, with evacuations underway after a vehicle\u8230\'20\'26 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/CGJnKIm6u5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/CGJnKIm6u5 }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 R A W S A L E R T S (@rawsalerts) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rawsalerts/status/1727393535681335569?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 22, 2023 }}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.46pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.37pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Explosion at US-Canada border near Niagara Falls\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FBI\uc2  and other law enforcement are investigating a vehicle explosion at the international bridge that connects the US and Canada at the Niagara Falls.\par \par \uc2 The cause of the explosion is not yet clear but there are some dramatic images and reports by the Associated Press citing the \uc2 FBI\uc2  that the border has been closed.\par \par \uc2 There is talk of a vehicle bomb or an electric vehicle battery combusting, we will bring you details as they unfold.\par \par \uc2 enltrCanada/US Border closed at Niagara Falls, Rainbow Bridge due to a possible VBIED, car exploded. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/tS2sSwwYOT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/tS2sSwwYOT }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 NYCFireWire (@NYCFireWire) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/NYCFireWire/status/1727391523459813696?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 22, 2023 }}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.38pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.33pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Here is Michigan\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic governor \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  explaining the Reproductive Health Act which sends a \u8220\'20\'1Cpoweful message \u8211\'20\'13 [that] Michigan is a place that fights for people\u8217\'20\'19s right to make decisions about their own bodies\u8221\'20\'1D:\par \par \uc2 enltrThe Reproductive Health Act sends a powerful message: Michigan is a place that fights for people's right to make decisions about their own bodies. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XaFeYGKOd9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/XaFeYGKOd9 }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Governor \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  (@GovWhitmer) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GovWhitmer/status/1727071700729340066?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 21, 2023 }}}\uc2  (@GovWhitmer)\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.20pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Michigan governor signs Reproductive Health Act into law\par \par \uc2 Michigan\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic governor \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  has signed a package of bills known as the Reproductive Health Act into law on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 In a series of tweets announcing the signing, Whitmer said that the RHA repeals the state\u8217\'20\'19s TRAP laws which are \u8220\'20\'1Cmedically unnecessary restrictions on hallway width, ceiling heights, HVAC systems, and janitor\u8217\'20\'19s closets\u8221\'20\'1D that have \u8220\'20\'1Cnothing to do with providing healthcare.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrAll these restrictions do is jack up costs and decrease the number of providers available to Michiganders.\par \par \uc2 Every time an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic closes, lives are put at risk and patients are forced to drive hundreds of miles to the find care they need.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Governor \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  (@GovWhitmer) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GovWhitmer/status/1727056333898186820?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 21, 2023 }}}\uc2  (@GovWhitmer)\par \par \uc2 The RHA also repeals another \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme law on the books from 1931 that would have criminalized nurses and doctors for prescribing medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  including mifepristone\u8221\'20\'1D, said Whitmer.\par \par \uc2 enltrWhile other states restrict access to these pills, we are making sure Michigan health care providers and patients have every option available.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Governor \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  (@GovWhitmer) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GovWhitmer/status/1727056342991458318?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 21, 2023 }}}\uc2  (@GovWhitmer)\par \par \uc2 The RHA also ensures that students at the state\u8217\'20\'19s public universities have access to information about their reproductive health options.\par \par \uc2 enltrThird, the RHA ensures students at Michigan public universities have access to information about all their reproductive health options.\par \par \uc2 For too long, you could be denied access to information about your options\u8212\'20\'14including \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14depending on where you went to college.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Governor \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  (@GovWhitmer) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GovWhitmer/status/1727056345302712761?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 21, 2023 }}}\uc2  (@GovWhitmer)\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.26pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 6.00pm GMT\par \par \uc2 ACLU\uc2  issues holiday guides on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  discussion\par \par \uc2 The American Civil Liberties Union\uc2  has issued several guides on how to talk about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access over the holidays.\par \par \uc2 In a guide by ACLU Alabama, the organization wrote:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAlabama has one of the highest rates of infant and maternal mortality in the nation. Restricting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access only worsens this issue.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrDoes the possibility of politics coming up at the dinner table have you feeling anxious? Don't sweat it, we've got you covered. Save this post & let us help guide the conversation.\par \par \uc2 Up first: \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Head into the holidays ready to discuss reproductive freedom with your folks. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/sOV5RlWyRL"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/sOV5RlWyRL }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 ACLU of Alabama (@ACLUAlabama) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ACLUAlabama/status/1727383118087180528?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 22, 2023 }}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, a guide issued by ACLU Indiana said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHaving deeper, nonjudgmental conversations in which you share personal, values-based stories has been shown to move the needle \u8211\'20\'13 even for people who start with opposite views. It isn\u8217\'20\'19t magic, and it doesn\u8217\'20\'19t work every time or even immediately, but these conversations can change the way Hoosiers think and talk about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrBe prepared for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access to come up in conversation over the holidays! ??\par \par \uc2 Our conversation guide has what you need to know about:\par \par \uc2 ?? How to talk about the importance of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access\par \par \uc2 ? Common misconceptions\par \par \uc2 ?? Combating misinformation\par \par \uc2 ?? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/eaSPAu4QZL"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/eaSPAu4QZL }}}\uc2  ?? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/8GvdXt2cDU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/8GvdXt2cDU }}}\uc2  ??\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 ACLU of Indiana (@ACLUIndiana) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ACLUIndiana/status/1727352537429266589?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 22, 2023 }}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 6.02pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.41pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Washington\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic senator \uc2 Patty Murray\uc2  has also voiced her support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, urging the restoration of Roe v Wade, which the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned last year.\par \par \uc2 Murray tweeted:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRT if you agree: we need to restore Roe v. Wade and the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for all women, no matter where they live.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Last September, Murray {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.help.senate.gov/chair/newsroom/press/murray-leads-29-senators-in-urging-biden-admin-to-strengthen-privacy-protections-for-women-seeking-reproductive-health-care"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 led }}}\uc2  29 senators in urging the \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  administration to strengthen privacy protections for women seeking reproductive healthcare under the Health Information Portability and Accountability Act.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 5.49pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 5.17pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Catholics for Choice\uc2  , a Catholic \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights advocacy group, has tweeted support for advocates of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access who may have different political views from to those around them ahead of Thanksgiving, saying:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe know the Thanksgiving table might feel isolating if you have different political views. Catholics who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access are in the pews, teaching Sunday school, & even around your dinner table.\par \par \uc2 You are not alone.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrWe know the Thanksgiving table might feel isolating if you have different political views. Catholics who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access are in the pews, teaching Sunday school, & even around your dinner table.\par \par \uc2 You are not alone.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Catholics for Choice\uc2  (@Catholic4Choice) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Catholic4Choice/status/1727344685700579791?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 22, 2023 }}}\uc2  (@Catholic4Choice)\par \par \uc2 In an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/jul/03/pro-choice-catholics-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  interview  }}}\uc2  earlier this year with the Guardian about pro-choice Catholics fighting to seize the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  narrative from the religious right, CFC\u8217\'20\'19s president, Jamie Manson said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCatholics overwhelmingly support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is because their faith taught them the values of social justice, of the power of individual conscience and of religious freedom.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 5.21pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 4.55pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Alabama\u8217\'20\'19s Republican senator Tommy Tuberville has falsely claimed that Democrats support reproductive policies that would allow abortions \u8220\'20\'1Cafter\u8221\'20\'1D a baby is born.\par \par \uc2 In an interview last week with Kimberly Guilfoyle, the girlfriend of former president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s son Donald Jr, Tuberville, who is blocking a handful of military promotions due to his opposition of the defense department reimbursing service members for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related travels, said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re going to pay for that by taxpayers\u8217\'20\'19 money. They can\u8217\'20\'19t tell us about the policy in terms of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  itself. You know, it\u8217\'20\'19s been rape, incest or health of the mom but we asked in one of our hearings what month are you going to go by for the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . They couldn\u8217\'20\'19t tell us if it was \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after birth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 enltrTuberville says that he is blocking promotions because women in the military may try to get abortions after birth under the current policy. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/30pKpTt6yP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/30pKpTt6yP }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Ron Filipkowski (@RonFilipkowski) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RonFilipkowski/status/1725271716560097467?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 16, 2023 }}}\par \par \uc2 In response to Tuberville\u8217\'20\'19s misleading claims about Democrats\u8217\'20\'19 support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after birth, Minnesota\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic senator Tina Smith said:\par \par \uc2 Did Kimberly attempt to acquaint Senator Tuberville with the criminal code? Because this is utter nonsense. But harmful nonsense. Senator Tuberville blocking these promotions is hurting our military.\par \par \uc2 enltrDid Kimberly attempt to acquaint Senator Tuberville with the criminal code? Because this is utter nonsense.\par \par \uc2 But harmful nonsense. Senator Tuberville blocking these promotions is hurting our military. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/WyWgIv6OPK"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/WyWgIv6OPK }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Senator Tina Smith (@SenTinaSmith) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SenTinaSmith/status/1725589382306959370?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 17, 2023 }}}\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 5.01pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 4.37pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  : \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans passed by \u8216\'20\'18extremist\u8217\'20\'19 people causing \u8216\'20\'18chaos, confusion and fear\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Vice -president \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  has released a statement condemning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans, saying that they are passed by \u8220\'20\'1Cextremist so-called leaders\u8221\'20\'1D who continue to \u8220\'20\'1Ccause chaos, confusion and fear \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 She added:\par \par \uc2 The women of America deserve better. Congress must pass a bill that restores the protections of Roe v Wade \u8211\'20\'13 and when they do, President \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  will sign it into federal law.\par \par \uc2 enltrAbortion bans passed by extremist so-called leaders continue to cause chaos, confusion, and fear.\par \par \uc2 The women of America deserve better.\par \par \uc2 Congress must pass a bill that restores the protections of Roe v. Wade\u8212\'20\'14and when they do, President {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JoeBiden?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @JoeBiden }}}\uc2  will sign it into federal law.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  (@KamalaHarris) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KamalaHarris/status/1727062830485061694?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 21, 2023 }}}\uc2  (@KamalaHarris)\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 4.51pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 4.09pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Virginia Democrats pitch amendment to state constitution to protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights\par \par \uc2 Democrats in Virginia this week proposed amending the state constitution to enshrine \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 The proposal follows Democrats\u8217\'20\'19 win in the state earlier this month in which they gained control of the state legislature, signifying a blow to Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 plans that included curtailing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access.\par \par \uc2 The amendment {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?241+ful+HJ1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seeks  }}}\uc2  to establish that \u8220\'20\'1Cevery individual has the fundamental right to reproductive freedom\u8221\'20\'1D in the state constitution.\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://vasenatedems.com/listing/virginia-house-and-senate-democratic-caucuses-announce-first-bills-and-resolutions-for-2024-session/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement }}}\uc2  on Monday, the majority leader, Charniele Herring, said:\par \par \uc2 Throughout the campaign cycle we told Virginians that a Democratic majority meant that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access would be protected in the commonwealth.\par \par \uc2 Today, that reigns true. Our resolution will begin the process of amending our constitution to protect reproductive rights in Virginia, building on the work that I and congresswoman Jennifer McClellan started many years ago.\par \par \uc2 It has become all too clear that without constitutional protection, access to reproductive healthcare is at risk for the commonwealth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 4.48pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 3.41pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Lawyers from the conservative Christian law firm \uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2  , as well as Cooper & Kirk have asked the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  on behalf of Idaho\u8217\'20\'19s attorney general to strip prosecution protections for ER doctors who perform abortions in the state.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg Law {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://news.bloomberglaw.com/litigation/idaho-asks-us-supreme-court-to-permit-abortion-law-enforcement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports }}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 Idaho requested the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  let it enforce a near-total \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, pending appeal of a decision that found the ban makes it impossible for hospitals in the state to comply with a federal emergency care law.\par \par \uc2 Attorney general \uc2 Ra\u250\'00\'FAl Labrador\uc2  Monday filed an emergency application to stay an injunction that prevents the state from imposing penalties on physicians who perform abortions in emergency situations, except when necessary to save the pregnant person\u8217\'20\'19s life.\par \par \uc2 The US didn\u8217\'20\'19t show that it\u8217\'20\'19s likely to succeed on a claim that the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law conflicts with the federal Emergency Medical Treatment and Labor Act, Labrador said. It\u8217\'20\'19s not impossible to comply with both laws because the emergency care law doesn\u8217\'20\'19t require anything that Idaho law prohibits, he said.\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 3.20pm GMT\par \par \uc2 2022 clip of new House speaker's comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as "American holocaust" surfaces\par \par \uc2 In a 2022 audio clip aired by CNN on Tuesday, the House\u8217\'20\'19s newest speaker, Mike Johnson, said that allowing people to get abortions is \u8220\'20\'1Ctruly an American holocaust \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 During a radio interview in 2022, Johnson also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://edition.cnn.com/videos/politics/2023/11/22/mike-johnson-trump-audio-kfile-ebof-vpx.cnn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI mean, the reality is that \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  and all these \u8211\'20\'13 big \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 they set up their clinics in inner cities. They regard these people as easy prey \u8230\'20\'26 That is what\u8217\'20\'19s happening across the country now.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Johnson also criticized what he called \u8220\'20\'1Cactivist courts\u8221\'20\'1D, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://edition.cnn.com/2023/11/21/politics/mike-johnson-kfile-invs/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saying }}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s been some really bad law made. They\u8217\'20\'19ve made a mess of our jurisprudence in this country for the last several decades. And maybe some of that needs to be cleaned up.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 4.54pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 3.02pm GMT\par \par \uc2 The Missouri supreme court has refused an appeal surrounding the wording of a ballot question on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in the state.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, the state supreme court declined to hear an argument from Republican secretary of state \uc2 Jay Ashcroft\uc2  who proposed asking voters whether they are in favor of allowing \u8220\'20\'1Cdangerous and unregulated abortions until live birth\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In October, a state appeals court ruled against Ashcroft, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://missouriindependent.com/2023/10/31/appeals-court-swats-down-ashcroft-arguments-on-missouri-abortion-rights-petitions/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calling }}}\uc2  his ballot summaries \u8220\'20\'1Creplete with politically partisan language\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Ashcroft, who is running for governor in 2024, appealed the court\u8217\'20\'19s decision but was turned away on Monday by the state\u8217\'20\'19s supreme court.\par \par \uc2 In response to the state\u8217\'20\'19s supreme court rejection, a spokesperson from ACLU Missouri {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.news-leader.com/story/news/politics/2023/11/21/missouri-supreme-court-declines-appeal-abortion-rights-case/71665450007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told }}}\uc2  Springfield News-Leader:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe courts\u8217\'20\'19 repeated rejection of the secretary of state\u8217\'20\'19s arguments verify that his case has no legal bearing but, instead, shows he will sacrifice Missourians\u8217\'20\'19 constitutional rights to gain the support and funding of special interest organizations to advance his political career.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 3.05pm GMT\par \par \uc2 block-time published-time 2.59pm GMT\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists across US launch fresh efforts to add measures to 2024 ballots\par \par \uc2 Good morning,\par \par \uc2 Activists across the country are racing to get \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights on the ballot in 2024.\par \par \uc2 The multi-state efforts follow a series of Democratic wins earlier this month in several states including Ohio, Virginia and Kentucky where voters rejected Republican attempts to limit or ban the procedure.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights groups in Missouri \u8211\'20\'13 where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is completely banned with very limited exceptions \u8211\'20\'13 have proposed 11 different amendments that seek to expand \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in the state, NBC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-election/abortion-rights-groups-seek-ballot-measures-9-states-2024-rcna125177"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports. }}}\par \par \uc2 In Nebraska, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights groups {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nebraskaexaminer.com/2023/11/15/nebraska-abortion-rights-petition-language-aims-for-viability-standard/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched  }}}\uc2  a ballot measure last week that seeks to enshrine \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in the state constitution. The measure proposes a constitutional amendment that would protect legal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care until \u8220\'20\'1Cfetal viability\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Democrats in Minnesota and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights groups are divided on how exactly to put forth the question of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights to voters. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.axios.com/local/twin-cities/2023/11/14/minnesota-abortion-measure-2024-ballot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According to }}}\uc2  Axios, the state\u8217\'20\'19s house speaker \uc2 Melissa Hortman\uc2  said that the idea is \u8220\'20\'1Cin the mix when we talk about 2024\u8221\'20\'1D, but said that they \u8220\'20\'1Chaven\u8217\'20\'19t heard clearly from voters or from the caucuses here at the state capitol that [an amendment] is the next thing that we should do\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, in an aired audio clip on Tuesday from 2022, Mike Johnson, the House\u8217\'20\'19s newest speaker, said that allowing people to receive abortions is causing \u8220\'20\'1Can American Holocaust\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Here are other developments in US politics:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Former New York governor \uc2 Andrew Cuomo\uc2  is considering a potential run for New York City mayor, Politico {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2023/11/21/cuomo-mayor-adams-00128380"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  reports }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Jill Stein has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/nov/21/jill-stein-2024-presidential-election-green-party-candidate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched }}}\uc2  her 2024 White House bid as a Green party candidate.\par \par \uc2 block-time updated-timeUpdated at 4.48pm GMT\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231122ejbm002e5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
