\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Ohio spoke tonight\u8217\'20\'19: voters add  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights to state constitution\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman in Columbus, Ohio \par \uc2 676 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2023\par 04:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 State\u8217\'20\'19s Issue 1 passes with more than 57% of the vote in latest backlash to Roe v Wade\u8217\'20\'19s overturning\par \par \uc2 Ohio voters resoundingly voted to add \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights to their state constitution, a major victory for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters in the only state where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is on the ballot this November.\par \par \uc2 Issue 1 passed with more than 57% of the vote, according to results shortly after the outcome was declared.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access has been embattled in Ohio since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe v Wade last year, sending the issue back to the states and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2022/jun/28/tracking-where-abortion-laws-stand-in-every-state"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 leading 16 states to ban}}}\uc2  nearly all abortions. Ohio has a six-week ban on the books, which briefly took effect until a court paused it. Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s results should prevent it from being reinstated.\par \par \uc2 After polls closed on Tuesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters gathered at a downtown Columbus watch party hosted by Ohioans United for Reproductive Rights, the coalition backing Issue 1. Each time an agency or news organization declared that Issue 1 had passed, cheers erupted across the party \u8211\'20\'13 culminating in an ear-splitting roar when CNN, which was playing on a widescreen TV, aired footage of the watch party itself.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COhio spoke tonight,\u8221\'20\'1D one attendee told another. \u8220\'20\'1CWe did it!\u8221\'20\'1D another yelled.\par \par \uc2 Lauren Blauvelt, co-chair of Ohioans United for Reproductive Rights, was the first to give a speech after the results were announced. \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is healthcare,\u8221\'20\'1D she told the watch party, to enormous applause.\par \par \uc2 Several speakers followed Blauvelt. Dr Marcela Azevedo, co-founder of Ohio Physicians for Reproductive Rights, spoke of sitting across from a woman who wasn\u8217\'20\'19t able to get care for her cancer because of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re going to bed knowing that we own our own bodies,\u8221\'20\'1D she told the party.\par \par \uc2 Americans have expressed outrage and disagreement over Roe\u8217\'20\'19s overturning in numerous polls, and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights advocates have so far won every \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related ballot referendum since Roe\u8217\'20\'19s downfall, including in reliably red states like Kansas and Kentucky. However, as the only state with an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related referendum in 2023, Ohio was a test of activists\u8217\'20\'19 ability to sustain that outrage and leverage it to fuel legal change.\par \par \uc2 Outside money poured into the race. In the last few months alone, the effort to champion Issue 1 and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights raised nearly $30m, out-raising anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  forces by roughly $20m.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents blasted Ohioans with advertising that claimed Issue 1, which protects a host of reproduction-related rights, would lead to minors being able to get abortions and even gender-affirming care without their parents\u8217\'20\'19 knowledge. Legal experts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/nov/03/ohio-abortion-vote-misinformation-warning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Guardian}}}\uc2  that these claims were overblown.\par \par \uc2 Because enshrining \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in state constitutions is now the best way to protect the right to the procedure, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related ballot referendums are in the works across the country, including in politically divided states like Arizona and Florida. More than a dozen states could ultimately vote on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2024.\par \par \uc2 Some speakers at the Tuesday night watch party brought up the 2024 elections, both in terms of what they could mean for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights and what Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s vote signaled about Ohio\u8217\'20\'19s place in the race for the White House.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COhio is not a red state,\u8221\'20\'1D said Kellie Copeland, executive director of Pro-Choice Ohio. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re purple as hell, baby.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden saluted the passage of Issue 1 in a statement. He also called on Congress to pass legislation to protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights across the US.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COhioans and voters across the country rejected attempts by Maga Republican elected officials to impose extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans that put the health and lives of women in jeopardy, force women to travel hundreds of miles for care, and threaten to criminalize doctors and nurses for providing the healthcare that their patients need and that they are trained to provide,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CThis extreme and dangerous agenda is out of step with the vast majority of Americans.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020231108ejb8000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
